				"&nLast but not least&r, Fission Reactor cooled with &9Water&r - can have only a half of its maximum burn rate enabled (&6burning rate = 0.5 is the maximum&r for the smallest Fission Reactor), due to &9Water&r's bad cooling abilites."
				""
				"开启前，请先设置好一个 &6Industrial Turbine&r 并将其正确连接到 Reactor 上。"
